        "source_id": "omalley_1964",
        "page": 4,
        "quote": "Vesalius, to protect himself, caused them to be published in 1538 with three figures of the skeleton drawn by an artist named Johannes Stephanus from Calcar"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "vesalius_bologna_demo",
    "event_type": "public_demonstration",
    "label": "Anatomical Demonstrations at Bologna",
    "date": {
